%% Title: MediSearch Authentication and Authorization Flow
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant FE as Angular Frontend
  participant API as Express API
  participant Auth as Auth Controller and Middleware
  participant DB as Users Table in Neon PostgreSQL
  participant Role as Role Policy

  User->>FE: Submit login/register form
  FE->>API: POST credentials
  API->>Auth: Validate input and credentials
  Auth->>DB: Fetch or create user record
  DB-->>Auth: User identity and role
  Auth-->>FE: JWT/cookie session
  User->>FE: Open protected feature
  FE->>API: Request with JWT/cookie
  API->>Auth: Verify token
  Auth->>Role: Check Patient, Pharmacy, or Admin permission
  Role-->>API: Permit or deny
  API-->>FE: Protected data or 403 response
